WEBVTT

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:05.950
Right now, healthcare work
is going out to tender.

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:09.450
Most of it is found too late.

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:14.850
The hard part was never the work.
It was the finding.

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:24.400
Qura pulls live procurement
from Find a Tender,

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:27.360
Contracts Finder, TED and SAM.gov.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:28.700
Every morning.

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:31.100
Each notice linked back
to the original.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:36.100
348 named decision-makers
across 171 organisations.

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:40.400
Find one person, then walk
the trust around them.

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:45.900
One profile, every compliance
document in one place.

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.000
Registered means they told us.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.400
Verified means a person checked.

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.500
Introductions only open
after that check.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:56.200
So when a conversation starts,
it is a real one.

00:00:58.130 --> 00:00:59.300
Qura.

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:01.600
Live healthcare demand,
and the people behind it.
